[I] Qualcomm QMI/TFTP firmware transfer server for modem devices

[T] tqftpserv implements a TFTP server that runs on top of the AF_QIPCRTR
[T] (QRTR) socket type, allowing a Linux host to serve firmware and other files
[T] to remote processors on Qualcomm SoC based modems and platforms.

[U] https://github.com/linux-msm/tqftpserv

[A] Linaro Ltd.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/system
[F] CROSS

[L] BSD
[V] 1.3

